    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Night elf</em></p><p>Your friendship with animals mystically deepens. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>You gain proficiency in the Animal Handling skill. If you're already proficient in it, your proficiency bonus is doubled for any check you make with it.</p></li><li><p>You learn the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.aL1F8fvYLtNzUbKu]{speak with animals} spell and can cast it at will, without expending a spell slot. You also learn the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.hDOENzjuj5WpLq7B]{animal friendship} spell, and can cast it once with this feat, without expending a spell slot. You regain the ability to cast it in this way when you finish a long rest. Wisdom is your spellcasting ability for these spells.</p></li></ul>",
